-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",25,{
[769]="700400E8\n1\tRecover supplies from Tingobel (total: 8)\tSupplies can be found through Tingobel in north-eastern Blackroot Vale. You have discovered various crates of supplies in Tingobel and should gather them for the refugees in Lancrath.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have recovered many supplies in Tingobel and have done a great service for the refugees in Lancrath.\n",
[770]="70071CCE\n1\tPick up Baradûm's journal in Jâr Obadal\tPick up Baradûm's journal in Jâr Obadal.\n2\tRecover pages from Baradum's journal (total: 10)\tRecover pages from Baradûm's torn journal in Jâr Obadal.\n3\tBring the journal and its pages back to Galêris in Ingar-garâsh\tBring the journal and its pages back to Galêris in Ingar-garâsh.\n",
[771]="70025961\n1\tCollect tarnished river-stones (total: 8)\tTarnished river-stones can be found in the possession of the goblins at Bleakleaf Crest, south of Dwaling. Wald Hillburrow has asked you to collect tarnished river-stones the goblins have taken from the Brandywine.\n2\tBring the tarnished river-stones to Wald Hillburrow in Dwaling\tWald Hillburrow is at Hob Hillbrow's just outside of Dwaling. Wald Hillburrow will be eager to see the tarnished river-stones that you have collected for him.\n",
[772]="7006852B\n1\tPlace posters in Lower Ward (total: 8)\tHadorion plans to spread wild rumours about Khâshap in order to draw him out. The first step is to place these posters around the city to publicly paint a target on his back.\n2\tTalk to Hadorion in the Lower Ward\tThere hang posters all around the Lower Ward of the city. This should create a stir amongst the residents. You should tell Hadorion. Hadorion can be found in the Lower Ward.\n",
[773]="7001A49F\n1\tUncover the mystery at Burgûl-stazg\tBurgûl-stazg lies to the north-west of Echad Mothelen. Mothelen has asked you gather information from nervous goblins at Burgûl-stazg; however, he also warned you to avoid being seen by the guards of the goblin-camp.\n2\tTalk to Mothelen at Echad Mothelen\tMothelen is at Echad Mothelen, south-east from Burgûl-stazg. You should bring the deserter's note to Mothelen with what you have learned.\n",
[774]="7002BC85\n1\tTalk to Saeradan to receive the pick-axe\tSaeradan is at the Rohirrim scout-camp in the Gravenwood of Dunland. Saeradan has spoken with the Rohirrim and is waiting upon you.\n2\tUse the pick-axe in your inventory to accept the quest Seeking a Solution, then complete it\tThe Tree of Tribute lies to the west of the Rohirrim Scout-camp. You should return to the Tree of Tribute and complete the task Saeradan set before you.\n",
[775]="7002C600\n1\tTalk to Fimloth\tFimloth is at Haldirith, in Thinglad. Limthir saw the shape of what he believes to be a Nazgûl on the shores of Anduin, and wants you to warn Fimloth that such a creature is loose in Thinglad.\n",
[776]="700000AB\n1\tTalk to Oswin Leek\tThe mighty guardian Oswin Leek is outside the North-gate of the town of Bree. You have been told to speak with Oswin Leek for further instruction in the ways of the guardian.\n2\tTalk to Burle Pierson\tBurle Pierson is at his farm south of Bree. The mighty guardian Oswin Leek has asked you to help Burle Pierson defend his farm from the escalating raids of the brigands.\n3\tTalk to Oswin Leek\tOswin Leek is at the North-gate of Bree. You have done as Oswin Leek asked, and Burle Pierson's farm is safe from the brigands. Guardian Leek is waiting to speak with you.\n",
[777]="70026F0B\n1\tFind the owner of the toy in Lhan Rhos\tLhan Rhos is at the centre of the Dunbog. You should return the toy to its owner.\n",
[778]="7002B3DE\n1\tItems from the shopping list can be found throughout Bywater during the Farmers Faire. The shopping list is in your inventory. You should collect the items on the shopping list...but avoid collecting items that aren't listed! This stage includes failure conditions; check the journal before choosing objects or actions.\t\n2\tBring the goods to Daisy Sandyman\tDaisy Sandyman is at her stall at the Farmers Faire in Bywater. You should return to Daisy Sandyman at once with the goods you collected.\n",
[779]="7002616C\n1\tHelp Deluraw with collecting fibres for linen\030Help Deluraw with collecting twine\030Help Deluraw with collecting wood\tThe Boot-maker can usually be found near the ovens of Duillond. You should speak with the Boot-maker to find out what is delaying his next shipment.\n2\tTell Santmereth that the boot shipment is back on schedule\tSantmereth can be found in the Festival Garden of Duillond. You should tell Santmereth that the boot shipment is in better shape now that you've lended a hand to the Boot-maker.\n",
[780]="700166F2\n1\tCollect Ghâsh-hai swords (total: 10)\tGhâsh-hai swords can be found on the Ghâsh-hai, roving throughout the Flaming Deeps. Ulfied needs Ghâsh-hai swords to melt down so he will have the iron necessary to build repair struts for the bridges.\n2\tBring the Ghâsh-hai swords to Ulfied at The Cross-roads of Ash\tUlfied is at The Cross-roads of Ash, in the south-west portion of the Flaming Deeps. Ulfied will want to begin melting down the Ghâsh-hai swords as soon as possible.\n",
[781]="70028E16\n1\tTalk to Answith\tAnswith is encamped near the tower west of Brôntrig. You should speak with Answith when you are ready to depart for Brôntrig.\n2\tTalk to Ardwyn at Forthbrond\tArdwyn is at Forthbrond, north of Brôntrig. You should return to Ardwyn and speak with him regarding the defeat of the Rohirrim at Brôntrig.\n",
[782]="70039552\n1\tDefeat Uruk-hai raiders\tUruk-hai raiders can be found roaming the fields around Bosa's Farm.\n2\tDefeat Uruk-hai raiders (total: 6)\tUruk-hai raiders can be found roaming the fields around Bosa's Farm. You have come across the burned remains of Bosa's Farm and the White Hand forces responsible. You should thin their numbers to protect the people of Kingstead.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated many of the Uruk-hai forces at Bosa's Farm.\n",
[783]="7006B719\n1\tCollect trinkets from defeated Ordâkhai (total: 8)\tThere is an Ordâkhai camp to the north-east of Iridír. You have been asked to go there and collect proof that you have defeated eight soldiers.\n2\tBring the trinkets to Girhâzi\tYou have collected proof that you have defeated eight Ordâkhai soldiers. You should bring the trinkets to Girhâzi in Iridír.\n",
[784]="70028104\n1\tCollect bandages (total: 8)\tThe bandages were taken by raiders from the Dragon-clan who have a camp in the ruins to the east of the cart. You should recover the stolen bandages.\n2\tReturn the bandages to the shredded bag\tThe shredded bag the bandages belong in is at Andras' cart in the north of Starkmoor. The bandages should be placed back inside the bag they originally came from.\n",
[785]="700168CD\n1\tCollect ichor from deep-crawlers\tDeep-crawlers can be found in the Second Hall of Nud-melek. You should defeat deep-crawlers.\n2\tCollect deep-crawler ichor (total: 8)\tIchor can be found on deep-crawlers in Nud-melek, on the eastern side of the Second Hall. You should gather ichor from deep-crawlers.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have collected the valuable glowing ichor of several glow-worms, enough to coat a number of lamps.\n",
[786]="7000EF7E\n1\tCollect salt (total: 12)\tFar to the west in Länsi-mâ there are hot springs around which salt encrusted rocks can be found. Gather salt from these rocks to bring back to Väinö in Norsu-leiri.\n2\tBring the salt to Väinö\tReturn to Väinö in Norsu-leiri with the salt you have collected.\n",
[787]="7000E901\n1\tCollect Brandy Wine from the Golden Perch\tThe Golden Perch Inn is the village of Stock in the Shire. You should pick up some Brandy Wine from the Golden Perch for delivery to Saerthuithel.\n2\tBring the Brandy Wine to Saerthuithel\tSaerthuithel is at Echad Candelleth in Tâl Bruinen, far to the east of the Shire. Saerthuithel has asked you to bring her a glass of \"Brandy Wine\" from the Golden Perch. Once you have the wine, bring it back to her.\n",
[788]="7006B69C\n1\tFind Agalûnu\tKalkhadra asked you to go to Arwáth and check on Agalûnu. Arwáth is a forest in the northernmost reaches of Ambarûl.\n2\tTalk to Agalûnu\tYou have found Agalûnu. You should talk to her and see if she is all right.\n",
[789]="7006A6B6\n1\tCollect lavender anemones near the pond (total: 5)\030Collect white anemones near the keep (total: 5)\tGella asked you to gather lavender anemones near the pond and white anemones near the keep in Lond Cirion.\n2\tBring the flowers to Gella by the pond in Lond Cirion\t\n",
[790]="7002C9BF\n1\tDefeat worms from the Teeming Nests (total: 15)\tWorms can be found at Teeming Nests to the north of Eorlsmead. You should go defeat many worms in Teeming Nests to lessen the threat of attacks by the evil creatures.\n2\tReturn to Sabert\tSabert stands at the gate of Stangard. You should return to Sabert with news of your victory over the worms of the Teeming Nests.\n",
[791]="7004BEB1\n1\tCollect stew from the cooking pot\tThe cooking pot can be found in Fushaum Bal South. You should collect stew from the cooking pot.\n2\tNurnhoth slaves can be found in Fushaum Bal South. You should give some stew to the Nurnhoth.\t\n3\tTalk to the Haradrim Commander\tThe Haradrim Commander can be found at Fushaum Bal South. You should talk to the Haradrim Commander.\n",
[792]="7006BF3D\n1\tGather unblemished acorns in Shakhdag (total: 12)\030Gather unblemished berry seeds in Tir Katar (total: 10)\tAvadhril asks you to gather acorns and berry seeds untouched by the Lâg Dávrit in Shakhdag and Tir Katar. Shakhdag is north-east of Vartúlin. Tir Katar is directly north of Vartúlin.\n2\tReturn to Avadhril in Vartúlin with the seeds you've gathered\tReturn to Avadhril in Vartúlin with the seeds you've gathered.\n",
[793]="700494CA\n1\tClean up slop (total: 12)\030Pass out drinks (total: 8)\tSlop and drink tables can be found in Thorzhaf. You should complete the tasks that Maukatish has given you.\n2\tSleeping Orcs can be found in Thorzhaf. You should complete the tasks that Maukatish has given you.\t\n3\tTalk to Maukatish\tMaukatish can be found at Thorzhaf. You should speak with Maukatish.\n",
[794]="700718F1\n1\tGo to the bandit camp at Zakhûr\tSikût has asked you to look for his missing pendant while you are in Zakhûr and return it to him. Zakhûr is an encampment east of Khanâg Gur in An Shêru.\n2\tFind the pendant in the camp\tYou have arrived at Zakhûr. Sikût has asked you to look for his missing pendant while you are in Zakhûr and return it to him.\n3\tReturn the pendant to Sikût at Khanâg Gur\tYou have found the pendant that Sikût asked you to look for in Zakhûr. You should bring it to him in Khanâg Gur.\n",
[795]="70028146\n1\tCollect pots (total: 6)\tThe pottery missing from the crate must have been taken into the hills to the east by the Dragon-clan raiders. You should recover the missing pottery.\n2\tReturn the pots to the crate\tThe crate to safely transport the remaining pots is at Andras' cart on the northern road of Starkmoor. The pots should be returned to the crate from which they were stolen.\n",
[796]="7001E4CF\n1\tCollect dry branches (total: 10)\tDry branches for kindling can be found throughout the Drownholt where the ground is a little higher, due west of Estolad Mernael. You should collect dry branches for the Elves at Estolad Mernael.\n2\tBring the branches to Rocheledh at Estolad Mernael\tRocheledh is in Estolad Mernael in the Drownholt, tending his sick horse. You should bring the dry branches for kindling to Rocheledh, who will be grateful for the cleaner camp-fires.\n",
[797]="7006ABED\n1\tTalk to the bookseller Ephrâti in Tilmakhím\tAmarêkh has asked you to go north to a place called Tilmakhím, the Cross-roads. There the bookseller Ephrâti should have the book \"A Smouldering Fire\" for Amarêkh.\n2\tDefeat Tilmakhím rats (total: 7)\tEphrâti has asked you to deal with the rat menace.\n3\tReturn to Ephrâti the bookseller\tReturn to Ephrâti the bookseller. Ephrâti can be found in Tilmakhím in Takhdâr.\n4\tReturn to Amarêkh in Mekab-kuphâr with the book\tReturn to Amarêkh in Mekab-kuphâr, in southern Khabârkhad, with the book.\n",
[798]="7002BFCA\n1\tDefeat turtles in the Rushgore (total: 8)\tTurtles can be found throughout the Rushgore. Frogildi has asked you to cull the numbers of the turtles in the Rushgore.\n2\tTalk to Frogildi at the Woodman camp in the Rushgore\tFrogildi is at the Woodman camp at the heart of the Rushgore. You should return to Frogildi with news of your success.\n",
[799]="7003E445\n1\tFind the white marker stone indicating the path to Thorenhad\tThe wolves of the Bruinen Gorges stalk the vale between the main road and Thorenhad. Fimgris told you to follow the road east to the white marker stone, then turn north. Fimgris has asked you to defeat some of the crazed wolves of the Bruinen Gorges in hopes that you might discover what has disturbed them.\n2\tDefeat wolves in the Bruinen Gorges (total: 5)\tThe wolves of the Bruinen Gorges stalk the vale between the main road and Thorenhad. Fimgris told you to follow the road east to the white marker stone, then turn north. Fimgris has asked you to defeat some of the crazed wolves of the Bruinen Gorges in hopes that you might discover what has disturbed them.\n",
[800]="7004A392\n1\tLook for already-looted packs\030Find and confront the sneak\tLook for more already-looted packs near the central road in Udûn, in hopes of finding the sneak.\n2\tCompleted\tFound and defeated the pack-looting sneak.\n",
})
